===Etymology===
Latin [[videre]]; Italian [[vedere]]; Spanish, Portuguese [[ver]]; French [[voir]]

===Verb===
{{eo-verb|vid}}

# to [[see]]
#:  Nolonge, mi ekis malbone '''vidi'''; mi eble necesas okulvitrojn.
#:  ''Recently I started to see poorly; maybe I need glasses.''

===Related terms===
* [[antaŭvidi]], to [[foresee]]
* [[ekvidi]], to [[glimpse]]
* [[pretervidi]], to [[look]] beyond; to [[overlook]]

===See also===
